# R1 acceptance transcript: extensional collections.
#
# S18 |- R1. Collections become extensional.
#
# `strata/system/collections.strata` declares what a `Map`, a `Set`, a `Seq`
# and a `KeySeq` mean -- unique keys, canonical enumeration in the one
# canonical order, persistent update, membership, explicit sequence order,
# keyed identity under reorder -- and no constructors, so nothing on the
# Strata side can observe which structure the host keeps. The host performs
# the primitives; the laws in the module say what its answers must be; the
# checks run the laws.

